<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>以下邊個圖形有兩條對稱軸？A.等腰三角形 B.等邊三角形 C.長方形 D.平行四邊形</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>菱形有幾多條對稱軸？畫出嚟並解釋。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:88px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>一個平行四邊形（非菱形非正方形），有冇對稱軸？點解？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
