<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>一個平行四邊形（非特殊）有對稱軸嗎？用草圖解釋。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>正六邊形有幾多條對稱軸？畫圖標出最少三條。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:62px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>畫出一個有斜向對稱軸的圖形（45度對稱軸）。</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:62px;"></td></tr>
</table>
